            "ref": "refs/changes/13/88513/1",
            "uploader": {
                "name": "Eldin Lee",
                "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                "username": "eldin-lee"
            },
            "createdOn": 1773986890,
            "author": {
                "name": "Eldin Lee",
                "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                "username": "eldin-lee"
            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "If these are Spare, why are they listed in the default config?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eldin Lee",
                        "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "eldin-lee"
                    },
                    "message": "The spec defines Rack S3\u2013S5 as spare leak sensors, but still includes actions that generate rack leak event logs and even trigger PSU off.\nSince leak logs are supported, I also added the corresponding cable logs.\nShould we drop these cable logs for cables labeled as \"spare\"?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "@eldin.lee@quantatw.com If there is any cable which is not expected to be connected for all rack types using RMCv2, then it shouldn't be part of this default config. Please look into the list from this perspective and make the changes accordingly."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eldin Lee",
                        "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "eldin-lee"
                    },
                    "message": "We only keep Rack Leak S1, S9, and S12 for monitoring. According to the spec, these are required connections for all IT racks."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 54,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "@paligill@gmail.com - Do we want all of these in the default configuration?  It seems like that means we're going to get spurious events until the configure service gets around to deploying the rack-specific config."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 54,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Amithash Prasad",
                        "email": "amithash@meta.com",
                        "username": "amithash"
                    },
                    "message": "can we rename this to \"cable-config-reference.json\" so we have something with all possible options. And \"cable-config.json\" could default to just the rack level signals."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 54,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "We should already have a \"reference\" from the EM config of what all possible options are, right?\n\nMy understanding is that this is the default file to use for the required plug detection unless an alternative file is deployed."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 54,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes, agree the default config should contain which are expected to be connected, otherwise we will get un-necessary messages for spare (if they are not expected to be connected all the time).\n\nAnything extra shall be added to configure service config which will over-ride this default config."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 54,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eldin Lee",
                        "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "eldin-lee"
                    },
                    "message": "I\u2019d like to confirm whether this version is suitable as the default configuration, or if any items should be excluded."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 54,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "@eldin.lee@quantatw.com If there is any cable which is not expected to be connected for all rack types using RMCv2, then it shouldn't be part of this default config. Please look into the list from this perspective and make the changes accordingly."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-ventura2/recipes-phosphor/sensors/dbus-sensors/cable-config.json",
                    "line": 54,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eldin Lee",
                        "email": "eldin.lee@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "eldin-lee"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                }
            ],
